## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Gemini API Key Required**
> You'll need to provide a Gemini API key. I can set this up as an environment variable in your Supabase Edge Function secrets.

> [!NOTE]
> **Alternative: Client-Side Parsing**
> If you prefer not to use Edge Functions, we could call Gemini directly from the frontend. However, this requires exposing your API key to the browser (not recommended for production).

---

## Verification Plan

1. Deploy Edge Function to Supabase
2. Test with various recipe URLs (Instagram, food blogs, YouTube)
3. Verify extracted data accuracy
4. Test full save flow
